### Player 2 game is over
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{gameId}}/move
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "playerId": "{{playerId2}}",
  "row": 1,
  "col": 2
}

### Rematch

POST {{baseUrl}}/{{gameId}}/rematch
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.global.set("gameId", response.body['id']);
%}

